          "jcr:created": "Wed Jun 10 2026 17:15:38 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p>Fortune Brand Studio sat down with Stryker leaders to explore how our connected digital solutions deliver value to our customers across the continuum of care.</p>\n<p>In this video, watch Chair and CEO Kevin Lobo, President of Stryker’s Medical Division Jessica Mathieson, President and COO Spencer Stiles and Group President of Orthopaedics Dylan Crotty discuss how our customers are navigating increasing operational pressures and how our connected technologies can help address those challenges.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://fortune.com/brandstudio/stryker/connected-technologies-smarter-outcomes-how-stryker-is-reimagining-health-care-delivery/\"><span class=\"standalone-link\">Read more on Fortune’s site here</span></a></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Jun 11 2026 13:10:45 GMT+0000",
